abstract: >-
  Full experimental record for the study of counter-evidence loss in
  retrieval-augmented generation: frozen benchmark, formal Experiments 1-4,
  metric-pathology analysis, independent generator replication, external
  metric validation, restoration analyses, superseded Experiment 4 runs,
  reproduction scripts, and technical report.

